                "title": "Question 1: Read a Text Aloud",
                "audioFileId": null,
                "imageFileId": null,
                "textScript": "",
                "textContent": "<h4>I'm Rebecca, representing the Ama Tours, and I extend a warm welcome to all of you in breathtaking Lombok. Are you tired after a long flight? I hope you're not. Now, let's take a moment to get acquainted with some important safety rules. First, please stay seated until we arrive at our destination and avoid eating, drinking, or standing while on the bus. Also, keep in mind that it's illegal to hit the bottle too hard in public. If you have any questions, please ask me. Thank you!</h4>\n",
                "spaceTime": null,
                "evaluateManner": "",
                "videoId": null,
                "audioDuration": null,
                "sample": "<p>I'm Rebecca, representing the Ama Tours, and I extend a warm welcome to all of you in breathtaking Lombok. Are you tired after a long flight? I hope you're not. Now, let's take a moment to get acquainted with some important safety rules. First, please stay seated until we arrive at our destination and avoid eating, drinking, or standing while on the bus. Also, keep in mind that it's illegal to hit the bottle too hard in public. If you have any questions, please ask me. Thank you!</p>\n"
              }
            ]
