                "questionnaireId": "D2A5580B-55FE-429C-8AFF-9D7CB5072A9B",
                "writingAnswer": "When having a interview, the decision maker is so importance because that person will choose a good or bad employee for the company which will decison performence of the company increase or decrease. \nFirtly, the employer should look at a way that the employee anwser some questions. These are help us know that the employees  are flexible, aren't they? The company have to a flexible person to give solution for the problem in the work. For example, by the answer way we know about their knowledge and experience in the work thanks to that we can easily chooose. \nSecondly, preparing from their clothes to their anwser about the poision is also benefit to give a good choice. A person has a prepare for the poision will good anwser of the employer and your clothes is fomall than a person do not prepare anything. That person will have high performence for the company because they will good prepare for the work before the meeting or task. \nOverall, the decision maker is also carefull about the choose employee for the company. If you can choice a good person that enough experience about the work, solution the problem skill and have carefully prepare before the interview, you will help increase performence for the company. ",
